Use code with caution.
• Run the visual demo with different drivers:bash
./demo_mdraw_shapes svg        # creates demo_output.svg
./demo_mdraw_shapes psc        # creates demo_output.ps (color PostScript)
./demo_mdraw_shapes pdf        # creates demo_output.pdf
./demo_mdraw_shapes p3         # creates demo_output.ppm
./demo_mdraw_shapes X11        # opens an interactive X11 window
